    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms do hereby give declaration that under Sub-Section (1) ofsection 5 of the Land Acquisition Act that the land morefully describedbelow is required for a public purpose and will be acquired under theProvision of the Land Acquisition Act.",
